        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vHg8t",
          "name": "note",
          "fill": "$--text-tertiary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "V8 (CPO): the warning is a caution, not a red error (nothing failed): same neutral surface as the held notice. Route unavailable or unknown, or role unknown: the warning drops its last sentence (no instruction). Count not renderable (null, 0, out of range, select failed): no warning, and the paragraph gains \"including any code changes your agent made that are not on your repository's main branch yet\". Confirm Disconnect, Cancel and the error strings are unchanged.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-primary",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
